00:40:58.215 --> 00:41:01.116
Now, we go below.

00:41:01.152 --> 00:41:04.246
Kol pooK beH poo

00:41:04.288 --> 00:41:06.347
Yoch bow math bow je,
Shuv weee

00:41:06.390 --> 00:41:09.450
Say moach chu may ew

00:41:09.493 --> 00:41:11.927
mah Shoov, maH nong,
ej ma choch chew

00:41:11.962 --> 00:41:14.590
nee beH yln maHj,
ach wov, coo!

00:41:14.632 --> 00:41:16.623
Bath ma cheth bejj,
ej yo'

00:41:16.667 --> 00:41:18.635
Keej DaHk,
vav poo ma Dee muv

00:41:18.669 --> 00:41:20.102
pa-rech ma Shoov tach Koo

00:41:20.137 --> 00:41:22.731
ma mev Ko'ma Shoov tach
ma ov.

00:41:27.845 --> 00:41:29.210
How's the intelligence
business?

00:41:29.246 --> 00:41:30.645
Oh, I can't talk about it.

00:41:30.681 --> 00:41:32.444
All I can do is read
these fascinating reports

00:41:32.483 --> 00:41:34.178
and analyses,
and analyses of analyses

00:41:34.218 --> 00:41:35.549
and then
keep it all to myself

00:41:35.586 --> 00:41:37.850
because no one else
has "a need to know."

00:41:37.888 --> 00:41:39.150
So I have to walk
around this station

00:41:39.190 --> 00:41:40.748
feeling like I, uh...

00:41:40.791 --> 00:41:42.122
You don't really care,
do you?

00:41:42.159 --> 00:41:43.387
No.

00:41:44.962 --> 00:41:47.829
A vessel's de-cloaking 15
kilometers off the station.

00:41:47.865 --> 00:41:49.230
It's the Rotarran.

00:41:49.266 --> 00:41:50.494
Martok's ship.

00:41:50.534 --> 00:41:52.229
Yes, sir, and there's
an incoming transmission.

00:41:52.269 --> 00:41:54.430
On screen.

00:41:54.472 --> 00:41:56.440
Major, we've rescued
35 survivors

00:41:56.474 --> 00:41:58.567
of a disabled
Klingon battle cruiser.

00:41:58.609 --> 00:42:01.669
Request permission to beam them
directly to your Infirmary.

00:42:01.712 --> 00:42:03.475
Permission granted, General.

00:42:03.514 --> 00:42:05.414
You're also cleared
to dock at Bay 4.

00:42:05.449 --> 00:42:07.246
We'll need an engineering team

00:42:07.284 --> 00:42:10.742
to repair our battle damage,
and one other thing.

00:42:10.788 --> 00:42:12.949
Arrange to have
15 barrels of bloodwine

00:42:13.057 --> 00:42:14.490
waiting for us at the airlock

00:42:14.525 --> 00:42:17.824
so that we can celebrate
the first victory

00:42:17.862 --> 00:42:21.798
of the Rotarran
over the Jem'Hadar!

00:42:34.145 --> 00:42:35.737
Worf.

00:42:35.780 --> 00:42:37.145
General.

00:42:37.181 --> 00:42:40.480
The High Council
has issued a commendation

00:42:40.518 --> 00:42:43.316
for the entire crew
of the Rotarran.

00:42:43.354 --> 00:42:45.982
It would seem
that you were right.

00:42:46.023 --> 00:42:48.491
They view the destruction
of a Jem'Hadar ship

00:42:48.526 --> 00:42:52.223
and the rescue of 35 warriors
as ample justification

00:42:52.263 --> 00:42:53.958
for crossing
the Cardassian border.

00:42:53.998 --> 00:42:58.367
Your... actions
on the Rotarran...

00:42:58.402 --> 00:43:00.632
at the time,
I thought they were disloyal

00:43:00.671 --> 00:43:03.139
but I have come to realize

00:43:03.174 --> 00:43:05.642
that your intention
was to remind me of my duty

00:43:05.676 --> 00:43:08.076
as a soldier of the Empire
and as a warrior.

00:43:08.112 --> 00:43:09.409
For that, I am grateful.

00:43:09.447 --> 00:43:11.244
You did the same for me once.

00:43:11.282 --> 00:43:12.806
Worf...

00:43:14.385 --> 00:43:18.947
on the Bridge, during the fight
when you dropped your guard

00:43:19.023 --> 00:43:21.992
how did you know
I would not kill you?

00:43:26.630 --> 00:43:28.222
I did not know.

00:43:31.936 --> 00:43:33.369
I see you're still wearing

00:43:33.404 --> 00:43:35.099
the crest
of the House of Mogh.

00:43:38.242 --> 00:43:39.766
Yes.

00:43:39.810 --> 00:43:43.610
Jadzia calls it
a... sentimental gesture.

00:43:43.647 --> 00:43:44.909
Ah.

00:43:44.949 --> 00:43:49.545
Perhaps you would consider
replacing sentiment with...

00:43:49.587 --> 00:43:52.556
the symbol of a new beginning.

00:43:55.326 --> 00:44:00.730
The House of Martok
would be honored

00:44:00.764 --> 00:44:03.756
to welcome the son of Mogh
into our family

00:44:03.801 --> 00:44:06.565
as a warrior...

00:44:06.604 --> 00:44:08.138
and as a brother.

00:44:25.321 --> 00:44:27.312
- Qapla'!
- Qapla'!
